BLAZE!

1ST AND 2ND TROOPS ARE ORDERED TO ASSUME A COURSE HEADING
120ø SOUTH BY SOUTH EAST. THE 33RD'S MISSION ORDERS ARE TO 
ESTABLISH A CLEAR ZONE FOR THE REGIMENTAL NIGHT MOVEMENT 
AGAINST REMAINING NATO OCCUPATIONAL FORCES. 

TO THIS END, 1ST TROOP AND 2ND TROOP ARE ORDERED TO SANITIZE 
THE FIELD OF ALL NATO MBT AND CFV UNITS. BE ADVISED THAT
INTERVENING TERRITORY IS STILL CONTROLLED BY DUG IN ENEMY 
EMPLACEMENTS.

GRU INTELLIGENCE FURTHER ADVISES OF THE PRESENCE OF AT LEAST 
TWO, POSSIBLY THREE ARTILLERY PLATFORMS IN SUPPORT OF FOUR NATO
COMBINED FORCES PLATOONS.

THESE ARTILLERY PLATFORMS ARE DESIGNATED OPPORTUNITY KILLS.







